  "summary_zh": "如果你有參加「冰原摩托車」的話，會在這裡集合。\n\n米達爾斯冰原覆蓋著卡特拉火山，周圍可從不同方向欣賞冰川地貌。冰面遍布裂隙，天氣也可能迅速惡化，禁止自行踏上冰川；如要健行、雪地摩托車或參觀冰洞，務必參加合格嚮導帶領的行程，並事先確認天氣與活動狀態。",
  "summary_en": "If you are joining an “ice field snowmobile” tour, meet here. Myrdalsjokull covers the Katla volcano, and the surrounding glacier landscape can be viewed from various directions. The ice surface is riddled with crevasses and weather can deteriorate quickly, so walking on the glacier is prohibited; for hiking, snowmobiling, or ice‑cave visits, be sure to join a qualified guided tour and check the weather and activity conditions in advance.",
